        <mxCell id="note1" parent="aQYUL5e1VUzBpmSmu_Mf-10" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fillColor=#FFFFCC;strokeColor=#CCCC00;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;spacingRight=5;" value="&lt;b&gt;Cross-cutting concerns:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• All services register with &lt;b&gt;Consul&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  [3-node EC2 ASG / mTLS Connect]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• kafka-sidecar → &lt;b&gt;Apicurio Registry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  [Schema lookup / REST]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• account, platform-registration,&lt;br&gt;  connector-admin, opensearch-manager&lt;br&gt;  all use &lt;b&gt;Aurora PostgreSQL&lt;/b&gt; [JDBC/mTLS]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• repository-service also uses&lt;br&gt;  &lt;b&gt;System S3&lt;/b&gt; for blob CRUD [S3 API]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• opensearch-manager → &lt;b&gt;Metadata&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;b&gt;Governance&lt;/b&gt; [Dimension config / REST]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Additional modules: module-proxy,&lt;br&gt;  module-echo, module-pipeline-probe" vertex="1">
